  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Pavithra vs The Commissioner on 11 January, 2024 Author: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan Bench: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan W.P.(MD)No Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 11.01.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mrs Justice V.Bhavani Subbaroyan W.P.(MD)No.31325 of 2023 and W.M.P.(MD)Nos.26873 & 26874 of 2023 Pavithra ... Petitioner Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Administrative of Medicine Department, Chennai. 2.The District Collector, Madurai District, Madurai. 3.The District Designated Officer, Food Safety and Administrative of Medicine Department, Madurai District . ... Respondents Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India, Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to call for the records relating to the imp orders passed by the third respondent Na.Ka.No.2704/A2/2023/Vu.Pa.A.dated 08.12.2023 and quash the same as illegal and consequently directing the thir respondent remove the lock and seal made on 20.12.2023 at the petitioner's s namely Ponmalai Store T.P.K.Road, Periyar Bus Stand, Madurai 625 001. For Petitioner : Mr.D.Arun Kumar For R1 to R3 : Mr.D.Gandhiraj Special Government Pleader https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis ** * * * 1/3 W.P.(M Pavithra vs The Commissioner on 11 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/163794365/ 1 ORDER",
